---
import { Picture } from "astro:assets";
import portrait from "../assets/about/portrait.jpg";
import SectionHeading from "./SectionHeading.astro";
import { site } from "../lib/site";
---

<section class="page-section" aria-labelledby="about">
  <SectionHeading id="about">About</SectionHeading>
  <div class="ab-card">
    <Picture
      class="portrait"
      src={portrait}
      alt={`Portrait of ${site.name}`}
      widths={[portrait.width]}
      formats={["avif", "webp"]}
    />
    <div class="ab-card__body about-text">
      <p>
        Engineer by training, I started out by co-founding Luseed, a bootstrapped hardware startup
        that turned a profit with clients like Total and PMU. Since then I've spent 10 years building
        products at Agricool, Frichti, Gorillas and now Bicytrust.
      </p>
      <p>
        At Bicytrust I'm the first product and tech hire. I write the specs and a good part of the code
        (React/TypeScript, Supabase, a lot of AI agents), and I work on our go-to-market: 600+ partner
        bike shops today.
      </p>
      <p>I like 0→1 as much as scale, as long as I stay close to the code and the customers.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-text {
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .portrait {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 240px;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }
</style>
